      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The PS4 controller support is horribly broken in vrchat. It got even worse after the last update because you cant open the menu anymore.\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/ps4-controller-uses-triggers-instead-of-the-joystick-for-camera-movement",
